    "body": "I think this is a specification, not a bug.\r\nThis option does not take effect if the path is not truncated(that is, `truncation_length = 0`).\r\n\r\nI think the documentation should be fixed, but I don't think this behavior needs to be fixed.\r\nWhat do you think?",
